{"event_id": "0e5aeedc-2014-431b-a9e6-32fc8167e1f9", "event_type": "artifact_created", "timestamp": "2026-08-17T12:17:07.495473Z", "session_id": "48b3c906-90ac-4e88-b315-5b00934a7135", "actor": "human", "authority": "accepted", "payload": {"artifact_id": "f85cc674-5e47-4628-964d-c5eed31e1acd", "artifact_type": "ResearchTask", "properties": {"description": "Re-encode facer art to cut ebook/web weight ~90% at unchanged pixel dimensions. Measured: all PNGs are 1024x1536 (~128 DPI at 8x10) — modest, so DO NOT downsize pixels. Cost is encoding: ~2 bytes/pixel PNG on photographic art, 2.5-3.4MB/file, 3.07MB over the wire per illustration on the live site. Convert facer/ to JPEG or WebP; keep lineart/ as PNG (flat line art compresses well). Must update both assets/art/ and book/images/ — they are byte-identical duplicates."}, "from_state": null, "to_state": "proposed"}}
{"event_id": "038bb5c9-b8a7-43d1-a6d9-91d67b360abd", "event_type": "artifact_created", "timestamp": "2026-08-17T12:17:08.211973Z", "session_id": "849b32ac-f7bf-4b16-802f-3e54c419f865", "actor": "human", "authority": "accepted", "payload": {"artifact_id": "aa47145d-81f5-4618-b340-c86f1392c3b8", "artifact_type": "ResearchTask", "properties": {"description": "Run and validate the typst PDF export: 'cd book && myst build --typst'. Never executed against this content. Unverified: the plain_typst_book template, the exports/overresponsible-ai-handbook.pdf output path, and the cover: images/cover.png key in book/myst.yml. HTML path is confirmed working; typst is not."}, "from_state": null, "to_state": "proposed"}}
