{"event_id": "adfb723d-0737-4a24-ab12-d678dd697d46", "event_type": "artifact_updated", "timestamp": "2026-08-17T12:39:30.180372Z", "session_id": "a05a8e48-0fd4-4535-b028-9e9cbbba8fdd", "actor": "human", "authority": "accepted", "payload": {"artifact_id": "f85cc674-5e47-4628-964d-c5eed31e1acd", "properties": {"description": "Re-encode facer art to cut ebook/web weight at unchanged pixel dimensions. AMENDED 2026-08-17 per cc_tasks/2026-08-17_addendum_assets_untracked_masters.md: the earlier 'assets/art and book/images must stay byte-identical, change both' convention is DEAD. assets/ is now an untracked local master corpus (lossless PNG, never converted, never committed); book/images/ is the only committed art and holds derived web/PDF-weight copies. JPEG chosen over WebP because Typst pixmap support is PNG/JPEG/GIF only (see cc_tasks/2026-08-17_reencode_art_then_typst_pdf.md). Scope: convert facer PNG masters to JPEG q85 at 1024x1536 into book/images/facer/ ONLY; lineart stays PNG; no mirror-copy step.", "updated_at": "2026-08-17T12:39:30.180056+00:00"}}}
{"event_id": "23f4a98b-8a2f-419d-aee2-173cc545a88d", "event_type": "artifact_created", "timestamp": "2026-08-17T12:39:31.061827Z", "session_id": "847521e0-317f-4a2a-8797-3fc8089f0147", "actor": "human", "authority": "accepted", "payload": {"artifact_id": "7c893186-9c9a-43df-9b52-f4fd6deb59db", "artifact_type": "ResearchTask", "properties": {"description": "Flip project license to CC BY 4.0 International, superseding the prior 'All rights reserved / commercial work, no open license' position recorded in CLAUDE.md and README.md. Per Brock's decision 2026-08-17 (cc_tasks/2026-08-17_license_cc_by_4.md): matches the sibling ai-workflow-design. Scope: LICENSE at repo root with full legal code, README license section, CLAUDE.md License line, book/myst.yml license+copyright keys, and a CC BY 4.0 copyright page in both book/front-matter.md and manuscript/01_front_matter.md."}, "from_state": null, "to_state": "proposed"}}
